==History==
2016 
*The Giant [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards & Card Balance Update]] increased the Giant's Hitpoints by 5%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]] decreased the Giant's Sight Range to 7.5 tiles (from 8 tiles).
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]] increased the Giant's Damage by 5%.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level Cap to 11 (from 10). The update also fixed the “range bug" by decreasing the Giant's Range to 1.25 tiles (from 2 tiles), but maintaining his effective Range.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]] decreased the Giant's Damage by 5%.
*On 20/10/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (20/10/2016)|Balance Update]] decreased the Giant's Hitpoints by 5%.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September 2018 Update (5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]] made {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]] decreased the Giant's Hitpoints by 2%.
2019 
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#Pass_Royale_and_more_(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]] decreased the Giant's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.25 tiles), classifying his Range as "Melee: Medium".
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]] fixed a bug where the Giant was incorrectly shown as a Melee: Long troop in his card info screen.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End of November 2019 Update (26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]] added a card render to the Giant's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/2/2022)|Balance Update]] increased the Giant's Hitpoints by 4%.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Giant's Range to 1.6 tiles (from 1.2 tiles), classifying his Range as "Melee: Long".
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]] decreased the Giant's Range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.6 tiles), classifying his Range as "Melee: Medium".
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] decreased the Giant's Damage by 0.39% and his Hitpoints by 0.02%.
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).
*On 1/12/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] added the Giant's [[Heroes|Hero]] form.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Giant's hitpoints by 3%

